<%# Warehouse notification — the email couldn't be auto-filed and needs manual review. %>
<h2>Your update needs manual review</h2>

<p>
  We received your email for <strong><%= @deal.name %></strong>,
  but couldn't file it automatically.
</p>

<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @reason %></p>

<p>
  Your email has been saved in the deal's warehouse. A team member can
  review and file it manually from the deal page.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888;">
  Common reasons: the stakeholder name didn't match any investor on this deal,
  or we couldn't determine whether this is a meeting note or a task.
</p>
